{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T00:14:01.929Z","ordinal":20742,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a07e5d-58c9-7ea3-9701-367c14da4667","author":"/root/search_ui_gates","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/search_ui_gates\nPayload:\nClear-search fix UI gate approved. The new journey closes the coverage gap, and independent mock inspection confirms an empty field with installed rows intact and no stale result.\n\n[Review evidence](/private/tmp/cakebrew-clear-ui-rereview.D0LyDg/review.md)\n\nSource unchanged; fresh preferences/cache restored exactly; runtime released."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07e3a-7088-74f3-8263-cbdd479f00a0","create_time":1788826441.929544}}}
