ettings | ui-compile.log; PASS exit0,4.059s, warning-free; actual CakebrewUITests.m compiled |\\n| Full UI | `caffeinate -dimsu xcodebuild test -scheme CakebrewUITests -resultBundlePath .../ui.xcresult` with ad-hoc settings | ui.log; PASS exit0,76/76 journeys,0failures/no skips/no retries; suite1105.535s/command1148.281s |\\n\\nAd-hoc settings: `CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY='-' CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual CODE_SIGNING_REQUIRED=NO CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=YES DEVELOPMENT_TEAM='' PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER=''`.\\n\\nInstrument validation: all named test suites actually executed. Strengthened `testSearchingFindsCasksAndKeepsTheSidebarSelection` passed after invoking the existing mock search menu, waiting for nonmatching mockchrome to disappear, finding mockvscode, and asserting preserved cask sidebar identity. All six formula/cask notification leave-search/pending-search journeys passed. App/test executable paths came from this unique build, not installed Cakebrew. The separate search-clear journey is not present on this source and is not claimed covered here.\\n\\nNo product failures. UI runtime emitted nonfatal IDELaunchParametersSnapshot debugger-version messages; these did not stop any journey. Compile warning/error scans clean. Seven unit skips are the explicit CAKEBREW_BREW_COMPAT real-brew opt-in suite, not suppressed product tests. No locked-display or Cursor interruption occurred on this full pass.\\n\\nFresh persistent-domain/cache snapshot was taken immediately before unit runtime, after root granted the exclusive runtime lease. No prior agent's backup reused. App/runner processes all exited, then state.swift restored the saved persistent domain and cache. Fresh-process NSDictionary equality true; byte-exact cache equality true. Full source hash recomputed unchanged. xcodebuild finished result-bundle finalization and exited0. No source/configuration edits, installed app replacement, host settings changes, real package mutations, or unrelated process termination. One existing normal-startup UI journey exercises non-mutating real discovery; package-operation journeys use mock fixtures.\\n\\nReady for independent expert review of this exact source. No commits or publication performed.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07e3a-7088-74f3-8263-cbdd479f00a0","create_time":1788827712.094353}}}
