d reporter/native decoding, classification metadata, safe deterministic Markdown/JSON output, CI ordering, AGENTS pointer, and five duplicate Formulae removals. No actionable findings remain; git diff --check clean. Source hash matches fresh verification, and sources released unchanged.\n\nPrerequisite evidence read: /private/tmp/cakebrew-l10n-review-fix.Yq8NGA/handoff.md (two observed old-policy failures then final 16 tests/364 assertions green); /private/tmp/cakebrew-142-reverify.igj5Km/handoff.md (fresh warning-free Debug/Release, 436 unit tests with seven deliberate opt-in skips, UI compilation, pristine 76/76 UI journeys without retry, reporter tests/native lints pass and exact state restoration); prior unchanged-surface UI approval /private/tmp/cakebrew-142-ui.Bwegyu/review.md.\n\nThese are pre-commit code-review gate approvals for the exact hashes only. Delivery authorization, subsequent integrations, and CI merge gates remain separate responsibilities.\n"},"started_at_ms":1788829032450,"completed_at_ms":1788829032450}}
