{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T01:15:52.165Z","ordinal":21808,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a07e95-f5e5-7d13-ba1c-9bd1ff729476","author":"/root/retry_test_session","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/retry_test_session\nPayload:\nAll three current-source verification gates PASS.\n\n| Slice | Unit suite | Full UI |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Search refactor | 442 tests | 76/76 |\n| Localization after review fix | 436 tests | 76/76 |\n| Search-clear fix | 444 tests | 77/77 |\n\nEach unit run had seven intentional real-brew compatibility skips and zero failures. All Debug/Release builds and UI compilations were warning-free. Latest full UI runs needed no retries.\n\nNew queued-clear journey passed in 12.699s. Fresh preferences/cache restored exactly; all owned processes exited; runtime released.\n\nEvidence:\n- [Search refactor](/private/tmp/cakebrew-143-verify.A7cxy6/handoff.md)\n- [Localization](/private/tmp/cakebrew-142-reverify.igj5Km/handoff.md)\n- [Search-clear fix](/private/tmp/cakebrew-clear-final-verify.YTuRSJ/handoff.md)\n\nNo source edits or publication. Final fix is ready for independent expert review."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07e3a-7088-74f3-8263-cbdd479f00a0","create_time":1788830152.165173}}}
