ock-only native toolbar queue-then-clear UI journey. Unit regressions were observed red; removing the generation guard made the UI journey lose installed rows, and restoring it passed. Full 444-test unit suite (seven opt-in skips) and all 77 UI journeys pass with warning-free Debug/Release builds.' && git rev-parse HEAD HEAD^{tree} && git status --short"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"[fix/search-clear-cancellation 341037f] fix(search): invalidate queued work when clearing the field\n 10 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n341037fa3585ee558e83fdce4017f62d8237b8f4\na2f18ca7cef85cfb9c31834f306d09b5d0459bdd\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"[fix/search-clear-cancellation 341037f] fix(search): invalidate queued work when clearing the field\n 10 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n341037fa3585ee558e83fdce4017f62d8237b8f4\na2f18ca7cef85cfb9c31834f306d09b5d0459bdd\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":11,"nanos":177335429},"formatted_output":"[fix/search-clear-cancellation 341037f] fix(search): invalidate queued work when clearing the field\n 10 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n341037fa3585ee558e83fdce4017f62d8237b8f4\na2f18ca7cef85cfb9c31834f306d09b5d0459bdd\n"},"started_at_ms":1788830353600,"completed_at_ms":1788830364777}}
